und-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">1: \"</span><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">כִּי אִם</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"> לִשְׁאֵרוֹ הַקָּרֹב אֵלָיו לְאִמּוֹ וּלְאָבִיו וְלִבְנוֹ וּלְבִתּוֹ וּלְאָחִיו</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">2:&nbsp;\"</span><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וְלַאֲחֹתוֹ הַבְּתוּלָה הַקְּרוֹבָה אֵלָיו אֲשֶׁר </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">לֹא הָיְתָה</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"> לְאִישׁ לָהּ יִטַּמָּא</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">3: \"</span><span style=\"color: #202122; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וְהַכֹּהֵן הַגָּדוֹל מֵאֶחָיו אֲ‍שֶׁר יוּצַק עַל רֹאשׁוֹ שֶׁמֶן הַמִּשְׁחָה וּמִלֵּא </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">אֶת יָדוֹ</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">...</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">4:&nbsp;\"</span><span style=\"color: #202122; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וּבַת </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">אִישׁ כֹּהֵן</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"> כִּי תֵחֵל לִזְנוֹת</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></p><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></span></h3><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">1- נגע עור<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">2- מעורבבת<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">3- מום בעין</span></span></span></p><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h3><p style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">אי,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">ירא,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">אשיר,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">ראשית,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">אשית,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">שית,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">שי</span></span></p></div></div></div>"
